        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Mind Lash"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, enchantment, mental, occult)\n\nA non-evil creature hit by an irnakurse's tentacle is overwhelmed with corrupted images of a ruined life and must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or be stunned 2 (or stunned 4 on a critical failure). After attempting this save, a creature is temporarily immune to Mind Lash for 24 hours."
            },
            "id": "a500037a-20fa-4bff-bc51-da094f1ee14e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:26.736825"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Sustain Soul"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Scream for up to 6 rounds; each time it does, it repeats the effect.\n\nCritical Success: The creature is unaffected, and is temporarily immune to Soul Scream for 24 hours.\nSuccess: The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 round.\nFailure: The creature is stupefied 1. Further failed saves against Soul Scream increase the condition value by 1, to a maximum of stupefied 4. Each time the character gets a full night's rest, the stupefied condition gained from Soul Scream decreases by 1.\nCritical Failure: As failure, except the stupefied value increases by 2 instead of by 1."
            },
            "id": "cb2478eb-b5bd-4809-abaf-c364bab924b7",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:26.736825"
            }
